<title>USA: Comair October load factor rises.</title>
<headline>Comair October load factor rises.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p>			  1996	     1995	     % Change</p>
<p>    ASMs (000)     241,963	  204,622	   18.2%</p>
<p>    RPMs (000)     139,018	  112,671	   23.4%</p>
<p>    LOAD FACTOR    57.5%	    55.1%	     4.3%</p>
<p>    PASSENGERS     416,916	  361,301	   15.4%</p>
<p>					 FISCAL YTD</p>
<p>			     1997	     1996	   % Change</p>
<p>    ASMs (000)     1,599,988	1,361,301	  17.5%</p>
<p>    RPMs (000)     924,434	  730,845	    26.5%</p>
<p>    LOAD FACTOR    57.8%	    53.7%		7.6%</p>
<p>    PASSENGERS     2,813,810	2,332,607	  20.6%</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Comair Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
